	~	Ton/Year/Year
	~		|

Pollution burden= INTEG (Pollution generation-Pollution mitigation,
		Initial pollution burden)
	~	Pollution index
	~		|

Pollution generation=Informal processing flow * Informal pollution factor+ Leakage to uncontrolled disposal\
		 * Disposal pollution factor + Formal processing flow * Formal pollution factor
	~	Pollution index/Year
	~		|

Pollution mitigation=Pollution burden*Pollution control practices/Pollution mitigation time
	~	Pollution index/Year
	~		|

Pollution mitigation time=5
	~	Year
	~		|

Processing time=1
	~	Year
	~		|

Recovered material flow=Formal processing flow* Formal recovery efficiency + Informal processing flow\
		 * Informal recovery efficiency
	~	Ton/Year
	~		|

Recovered Material Stock= INTEG (Recovered material flow-Secondary material use,
		Initial recovered material stock)
	~	Ton
	~		|

Secondary material use=Recovered Material Stock/Secondary material use time
	~	Ton/Year
	~		|

Secondary material use time=1
	~	Year
	~		|

Substitution ratio=0.85
	~	Dmnl
	~		|

Virgin material displacement=Secondary material use*Substitution ratio
	~	Ton/Year
